{
  "book": "3nephi",
  "bookName": "3 Nephi",
  "chapter": 15,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 265.148,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.669,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that when Jesus had ended these sayings",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.849,
      "end": 6.821,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he cast his eyes round about on the multitude,",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.001,
      "end": 8.626,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and said unto them:",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 8.806,
      "end": 13.45,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, ye have heard the things which I taught before I ascended to my Father;",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 13.63,
      "end": 17.531,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, whoso remembereth these sayings of mine and doeth them,",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 17.711,
      "end": 20.219,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "him will I raise up at the last day.",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 20.899,
      "end": 24.568,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when Jesus had said these words",
      "verse": "15:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 24.748,
      "end": 27.302,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he perceived that there were some among them",
      "verse": "15:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 27.482,
      "end": 31.708,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who marveled, and wondered what he would concerning the law of Moses;",
      "verse": "15:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 31.888,
      "end": 36.904,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they understood not the saying that old things had passed away,",
      "verse": "15:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 37.084,
      "end": 39.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that all things had become new.",
      "verse": "15:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 39.9,
      "end": 41.433,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said unto them:",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 41.613,
      "end": 45.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Marvel not that I said unto you that old things had passed away,",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 45.508,
      "end": 47.644,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that all things had become new.",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 48.324,
      "end": 49.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I say unto you",
      "verse": "15:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 50.037,
      "end": 53.799,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the law is fulfilled that was given unto Moses.",
      "verse": "15:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 54.479,
      "end": 56.847,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I am he that gave the law,",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 57.027,
      "end": 60.742,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I am he who covenanted with my people Israel;",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 60.922,
      "end": 63.523,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, the law in me is fulfilled,",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 63.703,
      "end": 65.932,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I have come to fulfil the law;",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 66.112,
      "end": 67.691,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore it hath an end.",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 68.371,
      "end": 70.693,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I do not destroy the prophets,",
      "verse": "15:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 70.873,
      "end": 73.613,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for as many as have not been fulfilled in me,",
      "verse": "15:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 73.793,
      "end": 76.487,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "verily I say unto you, shall all be fulfilled.",
      "verse": "15:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 77.167,
      "end": 80.975,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And because I said unto you that old things have passed away,",
      "verse": "15:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 81.155,
      "end": 85.613,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I do not destroy that which hath been spoken concerning things which are to come.",
      "verse": "15:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 86.293,
      "end": 89.079,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, the covenant which I have made",
      "verse": "15:8",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 89.259,
      "end": 91.535,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "with my people is not all fulfilled;",
      "verse": "15:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 91.715,
      "end": 95.337,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but the law which was given unto Moses hath an end in me.",
      "verse": "15:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 96.017,
      "end": 98.432,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I am the law, and the light.",
      "verse": "15:9",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 98.612,
      "end": 102.327,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Look unto me, and endure to the end, and ye shall live;",
      "verse": "15:9",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 102.507,
      "end": 106.594,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for unto him that endureth to the end will I give eternal life.",
      "verse": "15:9",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 107.274,
      "end": 109.968,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I have given unto you the commandments;",
      "verse": "15:10",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 110.148,
      "end": 111.773,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore keep my commandments.",
      "verse": "15:10",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 111.953,
      "end": 114.043,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this is the law and the prophets,",
      "verse": "15:10",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 114.223,
      "end": 116.591,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they truly testified of me.",
      "verse": "15:10",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 117.271,
      "end": 121.404,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that when Jesus had spoken these words,",
      "verse": "15:11",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 121.584,
      "end": 124.463,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he said unto those twelve whom he had chosen:",
      "verse": "15:11",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 125.143,
      "end": 126.722,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ye are my disciples;",
      "verse": "15:12",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 126.902,
      "end": 129.317,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye are a light unto this people,",
      "verse": "15:12",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 129.497,
      "end": 132.098,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who are a remnant of the house of Joseph.",
      "verse": "15:12",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 132.778,
      "end": 136.168,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, this is the land of your inheritance;",
      "verse": "15:13",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 136.348,
      "end": 138.995,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Father hath given it unto you.",
      "verse": "15:13",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 139.675,
      "end": 143.297,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And not at any time hath the Father given me commandment",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 143.477,
      "end": 147.099,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I should tell it unto your brethren at Jerusalem.",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 147.779,
      "end": 157.16,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Neither at any time hath the Father given me commandment that I should tell unto them concerning the other tribes of the house of Israel,",
      "verse": "15:15",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 157.34,
      "end": 160.219,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whom the Father hath led away out of the land.",
      "verse": "15:15",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 160.899,
      "end": 164.754,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "This much did the Father command me, that I should tell unto them:",
      "verse": "15:16",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 165.434,
      "end": 168.731,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "That other sheep I have which are not of this fold;",
      "verse": "15:17",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 168.911,
      "end": 172.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "them also I must bring, and they shall hear my voice;",
      "verse": "15:17",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 172.481,
      "end": 175.267,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there shall be one fold, and one shepherd.",
      "verse": "15:17",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 175.947,
      "end": 180.823,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, because of stiffneckedness and unbelief they understood not my word;",
      "verse": "15:18",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 181.003,
      "end": 185.368,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I was commanded to say no more of the Father concerning this thing unto them.",
      "verse": "15:18",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 186.048,
      "end": 188.091,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But, verily, I say unto you",
      "verse": "15:19",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 188.271,
      "end": 190.454,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Father hath commanded me,",
      "verse": "15:19",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 190.634,
      "end": 192.352,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I tell it unto you,",
      "verse": "15:19",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 192.532,
      "end": 196.851,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye were separated from among them because of their iniquity;",
      "verse": "15:19",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 197.031,
      "end": 202.232,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore it is because of their iniquity that they know not of you.",
      "verse": "15:19",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 202.912,
      "end": 205.28,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And verily, I say unto you again",
      "verse": "15:20",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 205.46,
      "end": 209.082,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the other tribes hath the Father separated from them;",
      "verse": "15:20",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 209.262,
      "end": 213.674,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it is because of their iniquity that they know not of them.",
      "verse": "15:20",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 214.354,
      "end": 216.165,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And verily I say unto you,",
      "verse": "15:21",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 216.345,
      "end": 218.621,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye are they of whom I said:",
      "verse": "15:21",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 218.801,
      "end": 222.052,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Other sheep I have which are not of this fold;",
      "verse": "15:21",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 222.232,
      "end": 225.622,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "them also I must bring, and they shall hear my voice;",
      "verse": "15:21",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 225.802,
      "end": 228.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there shall be one fold, and one shepherd.",
      "verse": "15:21",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 229.268,
      "end": 231.033,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they understood me not,",
      "verse": "15:22",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 231.213,
      "end": 233.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they supposed it had been the Gentiles;",
      "verse": "15:22",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 234.04,
      "end": 238.591,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they understood not that the Gentiles should be converted through their preaching.",
      "verse": "15:22",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 239.271,
      "end": 241.175,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they understood me not",
      "verse": "15:23",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 241.355,
      "end": 243.491,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I said they shall hear my voice;",
      "verse": "15:23",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 243.671,
      "end": 245.436,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they understood me not",
      "verse": "15:23",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 245.616,
      "end": 249.192,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Gentiles should not at any time hear my voice\u2014",
      "verse": "15:23",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 249.372,
      "end": 254.48,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I should not manifest myself unto them save it were by the Holy Ghost.",
      "verse": "15:23",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 255.16,
      "end": 257.714,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, ye have both heard my voice,",
      "verse": "15:24",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 257.894,
      "end": 259.055,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and seen me;",
      "verse": "15:24",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 259.235,
      "end": 260.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye are my sheep,",
      "verse": "15:24",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 261.04,
      "end": 264.477,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye are numbered among those whom the Father hath given me.",
      "verse": "15:24",
      "lineIndex": 80
    }
  ]
}